Description: Read depth maps and stereo pairs of HEIF, AVIF and JPEG pictures
 The readers branch of the edition's KImageFormats fork, 781f890..f0860c3:
 - Claim only stereo Multi-Picture Format files as MPO
 - HEIF: read the depth map and the other view of a stereo pair
 - AVIF: read the depth map and the other view of a stereo pair
 - JPEG: read the depth maps of Dynamic Depth, GDepth and Apple photos
 - autotests: test the depth map and stereo pair readers
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed (Sparky Stereo OS integration, pending upstream review)
